stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ToDo : Task Creation

    ToDo --> InProgress : Start Working
    ToDo --> Blocked : Prerequisite Pending
    ToDo --> Completed : Direct Completion

    InProgress --> Blocked : Impasse / Wait for Dependency
    InProgress --> Completed : Verification Success
    InProgress --> ToDo : Returned to Backlog

    Blocked --> ToDo : Unblocked
    Blocked --> InProgress : Resumed Directly

    Completed --> ToDo : Reopened for Rework
